  "prefLabel": "Gen 402.04 Renewal Application Processing Procedures",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Gen 402.04 Renewal Application Processing Procedures.\n\n(a) The OPLC shall review applications for license renewal as specified in Plc 308.09 and Plc 308.11.\n\n(b) A renewal applicant wishing to challenge the denial of an application for license renewal shall make a written request for a hearing pursuant to Plc 206.31.\n\nSource. #10687, eff 10-7-14; ss by #13556, eff 4-11-23 (formerly Gen 402.04) (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Gen 400); ss by #14338, eff 10-7-25, EXPIRES: 10-7-35",
